          <Text><cp IX="0"/><pp IX="0"/>A_TR / A_DEB / A_MIL / A_FIN = Analyse_hist.Trailer / Debut / Milieu / Fin.
Pconsigne = Analyse_hist.P_remplissage ; Pmax_Stand = Parametres.P_Max_Stand.
